{"id":804,"root":"نكل","bw":"nkl","tr":"n-k-l","found":true,"html":"<div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَكِلَ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span>, aor. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يَنْكُلُ</span>, see 1 in art. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فضل</span>. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النِّكْلُ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> signifies <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَلَّذِى يُنْكِلُ أَقْرَانَهُ</span>. (A, art. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عض</span>.) ― -b2- See <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَكَلٌ</span>. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَكَلٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> and ↓ <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نِكْلٌ</span>: see <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بَدَلٌ</span>. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَكَالٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> <em>Any punishment serving to give warning to others than the sufferer:</em> (M, K, TA:) or <em>that restrains the offender from repeating the offence.</em> (Bd, ii. 6.) </div>","pages":null,"shownPages":null,"chars":825,"entries":4,"shownEntries":4,"truncated":false,"match":"direct","key":"nkl"}